1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,637
Why does this supercar
suddenly shoot fire?

2
00:00:03,194 --> 00:00:04,175
It's not a flamethrower.

3
00:00:04,585 --> 00:00:06,287
Something even crazier
is happening.

4
00:00:07,076 --> 00:00:08,290
In some performance cars,

5
00:00:08,678 --> 00:00:10,430
a little fuel can escape
the engine

6
00:00:10,744 --> 00:00:11,704
without fully burning.

7
00:00:12,451 --> 00:00:15,384
When it mixes with oxygen
inside the scorching hot exhaust,

8
00:00:15,794 --> 00:00:16,391
it can ignite.

9
00:00:17,219 --> 00:00:19,119
That sudden combustion
sends flames

10
00:00:19,329 --> 00:00:20,510
shooting out of the tailpipe.

11
00:00:21,153 --> 00:00:22,236
It's called afterfire.

12
00:00:22,776 --> 00:00:23,322
And at night,

13
00:00:23,749 --> 00:00:25,410
it looks absolutely insane.
